      "fullDesc": "Our organic chamomile tincture is small-batch extracted at a 1:4 ratio using organic cane spirits and mountain spring water, drawing out the essence of the blossoms into a concentrated liquid. Chamomile is the herb of the evening wind-down — a dropperful under the tongue or in a cup of warm herbal tea has been the traditional way to close out the day for generations. Take 1–2 full droppers under the tongue or in warm herbal tea before sleep. Each bottle is 2 fl oz with a dropper top. Store in a cool, dark place. Keep out of reach of children; if you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication, check with your healthcare provider before use.",
