      "fullDesc": "From root to bloom, in one bottle. We dual-extract organic Echinacea purpurea — roots and flowers — in 50% organic cane spirits for a full, character-rich tincture. You'll notice echinacea's famous tongue-tingling sensation, the telltale sign of a fresh, well-made extract. Add 30–40 drops to a little water and take up to 3–4 times daily as part of your seasonal wellness ritual. Shake well before use; store in a cool, dark place. Consult your healthcare provider if you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication.",
