      "desc": "Indulge your skin in the ultimate rich, waterless hydration. Our Grapefruit Ginger Whipped Body Butter is a masterfully crafted, concentrated skin treatment designed to deeply restore parched skin, fade the appearance of blemishes, and lock in a radiant, velvety glow.\nWe have elevated our signature formula by infusing it with pure, skin-compatible Tallow and raw Shea Butter. Because tallow perfectly mimics your skin?s natural lipid barrier, this butter absorbs deeply without leaving a heavy, synthetic grease layer. Blended with nutrient-dense avocado and coconut oils, bound with pure beeswax, and whipped to light, creamy perfection, it delivers 100% active botanical nutrition with zero water or cheap fillers.\nInfused with the bright, uplifting notes of pure grapefruit essential oil and the warm, circulation-boosting spice of ginger, this butter energizes the senses while leaving your skin intensely soft and deeply resilient.\n Why It?s Premium:\nAncestral Barrier Support: Grass-fed tallow and shea butter offer bio-available vitamins A, D, E, and K to naturally rejuvenate stressed skin.\n100% Active Ingredients: Zero water, alcohol, or synthetic preservatives. A little goes a long way.\nLuxury Glass Packaging: Housed in a gorgeous, heavy, reusable glass bail-wire jar that looks stunning on your vanity and protects the integrity of our essential oils.\nHow to Use:\nMassage a small dollop onto damp skin straight out of the shower. Let the warmth of your fingertips melt the butter cleanly into your skin.\n\n\nWholesale & Bulk Ordering Terms (Case Variations)\n?? ATTENTION WHOLESALE BUYERS: Please read the following production and shipping terms before purchasing our 12-jar case variations.\nProcessing & Production Time: All wholesale orders take exactly 3 to 5 business days to process. To guarantee maximum freshness and shelf-life for your shelves, every single bulk case is meticulously made to order.\nShipping Policy: By default, all wholesale orders are shipped. > * Pickup Restrictions: Wholesale cases are NOT available for local pickup before 5 business days from the order date. Furthermore, local pickup is strictly prohibited unless it has been explicitly requested, approved, and officially scheduled with us prior to fulfillment.",
      "fullDesc": "Sunshine in a jar, with a little spice. Raw whipped shea and kokum butters are blended with cold-pressed ginger root oil and pink grapefruit peel oil for a warming citrus-spice scent that wakes up your senses. It glides on smooth, drinks in fast, and leaves skin feeling supple, soft, and lightly perfumed — the morning-person body butter. Massage into damp skin after showering, morning or night. Comes in a 4 oz or 8 oz whipped glass jar. For external use only; patch-test first if your skin is sensitive, and keep away from eyes.",
