      "desc": "SEASONAL LIMITED EDITION SCENTS\nINTRODUCING THE NEW Harvest Spice Body Butter!!!\n\nThese holiday favorites come to life with the scent of fresh sweet cream pumpkin, complimented with nuances of nutmeg, cinnamon, clove, and ginger; rounded out with buttery vanilla notes.?Every season these body butters become a BESTSELLER.\n\nWith memories of laughter in the air, and the smells coming from the kitchen, dominating our thoughts. When it comes to Thanksgiving or just the holiday season in general we all have special and fond memories, whether it is of a special guest, the origin of a family tradition, or a particular reason to be thankful.\n\nAnd last but definitely not least according to a study at the Monell Institute in Philadelphia, the smell of tge seasons harvest like pumpkins increases the arousal level in men by 40%. Yes... 40%, so maybe our mothers, grandmothers, & aunts intuitively knew this to be a true as they filled our homes with the scrumptious aroma of Pumpkin Pie.",
