      "desc": "Herbie Detox Blend contains a combination of licorice and complementing spices like organic licorice root, organic rooibos, organic ginger, and organic cardamom. Formulated for whole body detox.\n\nDid you know that historically, licorice root has been used for internal cleansing of the blood and intestinal tract, and is regarded as an important herb for treating kidney and respiratory ailments.?\n\nFormulated for whole body detox, this blend is a sweet licorice brew with a hint of cardamom (may help lower blood pressure, most likely due to its antioxidant and diuretic properties ) and a kick of ginger ( which has the highest concentration of gingerol and can be beneficial to your health when it comes to fighting infections and stopping bacterial growth). Rounded off with Rooibos ( loved for its high antioxidant properties as well as for its lack of caffeine )\n\n\nAlways consult with your physician before starting any herbal regimen containing ginger.\n\nOur line of New Herbie Ayurvedic Infusions aims to combine the ancient wisdom of herbs to educate, nature, ease, & support promoting balance between the mind, body and spirit elements.\n\n?These unique tea blends are meant to re align imbalances & bring you back into a healthy vibration within the world around us.?So make sure to do your own research on Ayurveda.?\n\n\nPerfect for the Herbie looking for a natural alternative.?\n\n\n\n\nThese statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. Consult your physician before taking any dietary supplements if you are pregnant or nursing, if you have a medical condition, or are taking medication. Keep out of reach of children",
