      "desc": "<p>Herbie Fatigue Blend contains a blend of Organic Lemon Balm, Maca Root, &amp; Chamomile.</p><p><br/></p><p>Formulated to assist...",
      "fullDesc": "<p>Herbie Fatigue Blend contains a blend of Organic Lemon Balm, Maca Root, &amp; Chamomile.</p><p><br/></p><p>Formulated to assist with all types of fatigue. What is fatigue? An imbalance that has a number of influences, including on one&#39;s habits, emotional state and physiology. In order to boost energy, one must not simply focus on ingesting substances that artificially boost energy, which most often can cause a sudden crash later. Turn your focus to balancing the three doshas and fatigue.</p><p><br/></p><ul><li><strong>Mental fatigue is associated with an imbalance in Vata dosha</strong></li><li><strong>Emotional fatigue is caused by an imbalance in Pitta dosha, </strong></li><li><strong>Physical fatigue is caused by an imbalance in Kapha dosha</strong>.</li></ul><p><br/></p><p>Ama, or impurities caused by improperly-digested food, is a major cause of all three types of fatigue. What Is Ama? Simply put... Ingested food ( or emotions ) turn into Ama, which is toxic, sticky, cloudy, smelly, substance that can spread from the gastrointestinal tract to other parts of the body. Ama or improper digestion is responsible for 90% of all diseases.</p><p><br/></p><p>The special blend of ingredients in our Herbies Fatigue Blend can aid in tackling the <em>Vata </em>related challenges of fatigue, as well as the more <em>Pitta l</em>ike emotional setbacks, like holding onto unresolved trauma in your personal relationships. On a <em>Kapha </em>focused physical level, Maca Root is known to improve fatigue by increasing energy, endurance, &amp; performance. Combined with lemon balm which directly assist with adrenal fatigue &amp; chamomile which reduces mental fatigue. This blend is the perfect for the ease &amp; management of your fatigue naturally.</p><p><br/></p><p>Our line of New Herbie Ayurvedic Infusions aims to combine the ancient wisdom of herbs to educate, nature, ease, &amp; support promoting balance between the mind, body and spirit elements.</p><p><br/></p><p> These unique tea blends are meant to re align imbalances &amp; bring you back into a healthy vibration within the world around us. </p><p><br/></p><p>So make sure to do your own research on Ayurveda. </p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>Perfect for the Herbie looking for a natural alternative. </p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. Consult your physician before taking any dietary supplements if you are pregnant or nursing, if you have a medical condition, or are taking medication. Keep out of reach of children</p>",
