      "compareAtPrice": 0,
      "desc": "Maca Root is an extremely nutritious plant, loaded with vitamin C, Potassium, iron, fiber, and much much more. It is often used to increase energy, stamina, and over all performance. Reduced desire during that special time when you partner wants a little attention is a very common problem among many adults male and female. Maca Root has been heavily effective at improving sexual desire, performance and stamina when used consistently over time, can assist with male fertility, sperm quality and quantity as well. In women Maca acts alittle different but is equally useful. Maca Root may improve your mental well being and mood by reducing depression and anxiety, especially in menopausal women. Maca root powder is very popular among bodybuilders and athletes. May help gain muscle, increase strength, boost energy, and improve exercise performance. Maca even has been said to benefit people suffering from enlarged prostate.\n\n\n\nThese statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. For Informational purposes only.",
