      "price": 9,
      "compareAtPrice": 0,
      "desc": "Did you know Neem tea is rich in antioxidants, vitamin C, and minerals. Many herbalist use it to assist with issues with digestion, easing pain, improve skin complexion, and controlling a fever. Neem has also been known to boosts metabolism, so it could be the perfect for you if you have trouble with weight management. Even shown to help fight inflammation and control diabetes. But have you heard Sage's Secret on how to use neem for your furry friends? ... If not then your in luck! Neem oil is easy to make and can be used for dogs as wel. Bet you didn?t know Neem Oil can help reduce itchiness with allergies, treat skin infections, fight fungal infections, and has even been shown to treat mange and ringworm. When neem oil used properly, there are many beneficial properties for yourself as well as with dogs to help them feel their absolute best . So make sure to use natural ingredients whenever possible. Remember buy natural! It's usually cheaper, easier, and always greener.? Always consult with your Naturopathic Physician, Primary Care Physician, or Vet before starting any herbal regimen.",
