      "slug": "wholesale-herbal-infused-handmade-soaps",
      "name": "Wholesale Herbal Infused Handmade Soaps",
      "cat": "natural-soaps",
      "price": 31.2,
      "compareAtPrice": 0,
      "desc": "Looking for all-natural vegan soaps that are handcrafted with love and care? Look no further than Herbalistic Wellness! Our Lavender Oatmeal, Turmeric Root Repair, Tea Tree & Peppermint, Peach Mango, Oatmeal Honey, and Orange & Calendula artisan soaps are sure to leave your skin feeling refreshed, moisturized, and glowing.\nOur Lavender Oatmeal soap is perfect for dry, itchy, and sensitive skin. Loaded with vitamins, minerals, antioxidants, and lipids, this soap is a real skin quencher that provides deep hydration and nourishment. The oatmeal in the soap has potent emollient properties, making it a great moisturizer that forms a protective barrier to keep skin hydrated. It also acts as a gentle exfoliator, removing dead skin cells and revealing smoother, brighter skin. Lavender oil in the soap provides a calming and soothing effect that promotes relaxation and reduces stress. Our Lavender Oatmeal soap is suitable for all skin types, including those with acne, eczema, and psoriasis.\nLooking for a soap that can improve your skin's texture, tone, and elasticity? Try our Turmeric Root Repair soap! This soap contains turmeric, which has strong anti-inflammatory properties that reduce dark scars and circles, fights off acne, protects against sun damage and aging, and soothes dry skin. The soap gently exfoliates your skin, removing dead cells and promoting cell turnover for a brighter, more even complexion. Turmeric in the soap helps to retain the skin's elasticity and improve its suppleness.\nOur Tea Tree & Peppermint soap is perfect for those who suffer from acne and other skin conditions. Tea tree oil in the soap has anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial properties that help to calm redness, swelling, and inflammation, preventing further breakouts. Peppermint oil naturally cleanses the skin and has antiseptic and antibacterial properties that leave your skin feeling clean, refreshed, and soothed. Use our Calming Blend Acne Astringent in conjunction with this soap to tame unwanted acne or prevent further recurrences for the best results.\nLooking for a gentle and moisturizing soap that is perfect for sensitive skin? Try our Orange & Calendula soap! This soap contains calendula, a useful ingredient in beauty products due to its anti-inflammatory properties. It eases eczema and psoriasis, provides antioxidant benefits, and gently removes makeup. The soap is made with an olive oil base, which gives a clean and buttery feel despite minimal lather. This gentle soap is perfect for those with sensitive skin who want to moisturize and nourish their skin without irritation.\nAll of our artisan soaps are handcrafted with the finest natural ingredients and are 100% vegan. And now, for a limited time, we are offering a 20% discount on all wholesale purchases! Try our soaps today and experience the difference that all-natural, vegan, and handcrafted soaps can make for your skin. Please note that these statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.",
