      "cat": "tinctures",
      "price": 18,
      "compareAtPrice": 0,
      "desc": "Ignite your inner warmth and restore natural digestive harmony.\nBring the fiery, revitalizing power of fresh ginger root into your daily wellness routine. Our Ginger Tincture is a highly concentrated liquid extract made from premium Zingiber officinale rhizomes. Prized for centuries across traditional global herbalism, ginger is renowned for its ability to spark healthy digestion, diffuse occasional stomach tension, and fill the body with a comforting, vitalizing warmth.\n\nRich in active, pungent compounds called gingerols and shogaols, this tincture provides immediate, fast-acting support wherever you go. Whether you need a post-meal digestive aid to ease occasional bloating or a reliable travel companion for a bumpy road trip, this pocket-sized extract delivers the pure essence of ginger without the need for brewing tea or peeling roots.\n\nKey Benefits\nOptimal Digestive Support: Soothes the digestive tract, encouraging smooth, comfortable digestion and helping to ease occasional gas or bloating.\nThe Ultimate Travel Companion: Helps maintain stomach comfort and eases occasional nausea or motion uneasiness during flights, boat rides, or road trips.\nStimulates Healthy Circulation: Promotes vital, healthy blood flow and delivers a comforting, warming sensation throughout the body.\nDaily Metabolic & Immune Backing: Packed with antioxidant properties that support metabolic vitality and fortify your body's natural defenses.\n\nPure Ingredients\nOrganic Ginger (Zingiber officinale) rhizome\nOrganic Cane Alcohol (extraction agent)\n\nSuggested Use\nFor Post-Meal Comfort: Take 1 dropperful (approx. 30 drops) in a small glass of warm water or tea after heavy meals, up to 3 times daily.\nFor Travel & Motion Support: Take 1 dropperful 30 minutes before boarding or embarking on travel.\nShake well before use. Store in a cool, dark place.\n\nRegulatory Note: These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Consult your healthcare provider before use if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medications (especially blood thinners), or have a history of gallstones.",
      "fullDesc": "Ignite your inner warmth and restore natural digestive harmony.\nBring the fiery, revitalizing power of fresh ginger root into your daily wellness routine. Our Ginger Tincture is a highly concentrated liquid extract made from premium Zingiber officinale rhizomes. Prized for centuries across traditional global herbalism, ginger is renowned for its ability to spark healthy digestion, diffuse occasional stomach tension, and fill the body with a comforting, vitalizing warmth.\n\nRich in active, pungent compounds called gingerols and shogaols, this tincture provides immediate, fast-acting support wherever you go. Whether you need a post-meal digestive aid to ease occasional bloating or a reliable travel companion for a bumpy road trip, this pocket-sized extract delivers the pure essence of ginger without the need for brewing tea or peeling roots.\n\nKey Benefits\nOptimal Digestive Support: Soothes the digestive tract, encouraging smooth, comfortable digestion and helping to ease occasional gas or bloating.\nThe Ultimate Travel Companion: Helps maintain stomach comfort and eases occasional nausea or motion uneasiness during flights, boat rides, or road trips.\nStimulates Healthy Circulation: Promotes vital, healthy blood flow and delivers a comforting, warming sensation throughout the body.\nDaily Metabolic & Immune Backing: Packed with antioxidant properties that support metabolic vitality and fortify your body's natural defenses.\n\nPure Ingredients\nOrganic Ginger (Zingiber officinale) rhizome\nOrganic Cane Alcohol (extraction agent)\n\nSuggested Use\nFor Post-Meal Comfort: Take 1 dropperful (approx. 30 drops) in a small glass of warm water or tea after heavy meals, up to 3 times daily.\nFor Travel & Motion Support: Take 1 dropperful 30 minutes before boarding or embarking on travel.\nShake well before use. Store in a cool, dark place.\n\nRegulatory Note: These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Consult your healthcare provider before use if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medications (especially blood thinners), or have a history of gallstones.",
